10309158,2024-10-01,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"XX/XX/XXXX Subject : Complaint Regarding Inaccurate Late Payment Entry on Credit Report Dear CFPB, I am writing to file a formal complaint against Experian regarding an inaccurate late payment entry on my credit report that has not been resolved despite my attempts to rectify the issue. 

