ceive the equivalent for emails. I am just frustrated bc I am being told there is no way to rectify the situation, so there is going to be a hit to my credit ( from the closure of an old account ) and while likely not huge, it cant be right that I have to pay the consequences for the closure without having been allowed the opportunity to prevent it.",,AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY,ME,041XX,,Web,2024-10-01,Closed with explanation,Yes
