me for those deferred funds. That deferring funds played only the role of supporting their lie, about what my actual costs of installation would be, and what my actual monthly loan would be once the deferment was over. The only ones to benefit from this lie was XXXX XXXX and NBT Bank, they sold two products ( solar installation and a loan ) that had I known the real cost would not have been sold. And after I filed my taxes and found out I had been conned, I then found out the true cost of installation of the system was over XXXX. And I would be responsible to pay back that entire amount. While this lie was started with XXXX XXXX, it was NBT Bank that enticed me into a loan that was predatory. They alone had the information on what the credit actually meant and they alone had all my financials to reflect that I would never see a dime from IRS to be able to pay this deferred amount. They alone are responsible for this predatory loan. And it was a predatory loan. 
